@startuml
actor GroupMember
boundary JoinTeamPage
control JoinRequestService
database Database
control TeamLeaderService
boundary NotificationService

GroupMember -> JoinTeamPage: View available teams
GroupMember -> JoinTeamPage: Search for specific teams
GroupMember -> JoinTeamPage: Submit request to join a selected team
JoinTeamPage -> JoinRequestService: Send join request with selected team details

JoinRequestService -> Database: Store join request
Database --> JoinRequestService: Return request status

alt Request successful
    JoinRequestService -> TeamLeaderService: Notify team leader of new join request
    TeamLeaderService -> TeamLeader: Display join request for review

    alt Team leader accepts request
        TeamLeaderService -> Database: Update team membership
        Database --> TeamLeaderService: Return update status
        TeamLeaderService -> NotificationService: Notify GroupMember of acceptance
        NotificationService -> GroupMember: Send acceptance notification
        NotificationService --> TeamLeaderService: Return notification status
    else Team leader rejects request
        TeamLeaderService -> NotificationService: Notify GroupMember of rejection
        NotificationService -> GroupMember: Send rejection notification
        NotificationService --> TeamLeaderService: Return notification status
    end

    JoinRequestService --> JoinTeamPage: Return request status
    JoinTeamPage -> GroupMember: Display request status
else Request failed
    JoinRequestService --> JoinTeamPage: Return error status
    JoinTeamPage -> GroupMember: Display error message
end

@enduml
